Comment: 9,0:23:29.30,0:23:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Jonathan Buczek
Dialogue: 9,0:00:24.42,0:00:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.59,0:00:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:33.55,0:00:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Inmate FE40536.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:36.77,0:00:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Name: Jolyne Kujo.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:39.15,0:00:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the second time\Nyou've caused us trouble.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.57,0:00:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you tried to escape.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, at the prison mausoleum,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:47.78,0:00:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}an inmate was found dead\Nfrom blunt force head trauma.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:51.66,0:00:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you refuse to talk\Nand you dare to defy us.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:56.24,0:00:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,For some unknown reason,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:57.96,0:01:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,violence and death follow you\Neverywhere you go.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:01.84,0:01:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no proof that you killed her,
Dialogue: 9,0:01:04.13,0:01:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're the type who causes problems.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, as of today,
Dialogue: 9,0:01:12.43,0:01:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be disciplined\Nin accordance with protocol.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:16.39,0:01:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be confined here
Dialogue: 9,0:01:18.06,0:01:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,for an indefinite period\Nin this ultra-high-security ward.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:51.30,0:01:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:52.80,0:01:55.47,TiretsDefault,,714,0,0,,– Damn it!\N– It's a woman!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:58.64,0:02:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman just arrived.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:00.40,0:02:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell a woman!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:03.65,0:02:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Her scent is seeping under the door!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming or what?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:12.16,0:02:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:14.66,0:02:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I smeared my shit on her face!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:17.70,0:02:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My own shit,\Non a woman's face!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:22.12,0:02:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna hit her too!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely must\Nstay mentally strong in here.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:31.38,0:02:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give in to needless stress\Nor physical exhaustion.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:36.34,0:02:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to accomplish\Nin this ultra-high-security ward.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to succeed, no matter what.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:48.36,0:02:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And to do that,\NI must preserve all my energy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must become even stronger!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:06.04,0:03:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It may be possible\Nto reach heaven.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:11.50,0:03:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sad.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about death.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:16.97,0:03:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The heaven I speak of
Dialogue: 9,0:03:19.35,0:03:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,concerns the soul.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:22.06,0:03:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the place our souls go.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:23.98,0:03:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Our soul's power\Nsurely evolves there.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:26.98,0:03:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I speak of the final form of our souls.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:30.36,0:03:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that you, in particular,\Nare capable of grasping this.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:34.90,0:03:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,True happiness lies there.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:37.70,0:03:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But to get there,\Nyou must reach heaven.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:40.74,0:03:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness can't be attained
Dialogue: 9,0:03:42.08,0:03:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,by having the strongest body\Nor plenty of money,
Dialogue: 9,0:03:45.04,0:03:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,or by dominating others.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:49.79,0:03:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,True victory
Dialogue: 9,0:03:51.84,0:03:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,belongs to those who have seen heaven.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:56.47,0:03:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do everything...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:00.26,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,... to reach that goal.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:37.90,0:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Say I put\Nthis sticker on this pen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:41.65,0:05:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}It creates a copy of the pen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:45.49,0:05:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's my ability.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I call it Kiss.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:49.71,0:05:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I remove the sticker,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:52.71,0:05:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the pen forcefully fuses with the copy,\Ncreating a crack.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:55.63,0:05:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It becomes easier to destroy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:57.96,0:06:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I consider this power\Na sign from God.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:10.43,0:06:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He'll remember very soon{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:13.06,0:06:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that this kiss sticker\Nis the mark of my revenge.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Father.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:20.69,0:06:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have one of these flowers?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.24,0:06:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I love them more and more.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:26.95,0:06:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, take one.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:29.17,0:06:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F., she just cut in front of you.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:45.84,0:06:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, she cut in front of you.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:48.35,0:06:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling
Dialogue: 9,0:06:51.60,0:06:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,that the others don't accept me here.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like they look down on me.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.61,0:06:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cut in front of us!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:59.45,0:07:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:00.61,0:07:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I disagree.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:03.19,0:07:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't force things.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.70,0:07:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You must change before seeking\Nthe approval of others.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:08.91,0:07:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:10.16,0:07:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I've decided to do the opposite\Nof what I usually do.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.41,0:07:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the opposite of coffee?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:17.25,0:07:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tea?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:18.17,0:07:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. This body of Atroe's\Nthat I've taken over craves coffee.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So I drink tea instead.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:24.84,0:07:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Deliberately.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:29.76,0:07:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that make sense to you?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of bread, I eat rice.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:36.02,0:07:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I use my left hand,\Nmy non-dominant one, to eat.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:40.31,0:07:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I try to change by doing\Nexactly the opposite.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:43.45,0:07:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, F.F.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where I got shot,
Dialogue: 9,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it hurts like hell.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:50.54,0:07:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:51.87,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only fill\Nthe holes with plankton.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.50,0:07:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest depends on\Nyour body's ability to heal.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:57.25,0:07:58.67,TiretsDefault,,822,0,0,,– Got it?\N– Damn.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:00.08,0:08:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, what's the opposite of pork?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:03.09,0:08:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe chicken, or beef.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:04.84,0:08:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The opposite of pork is salmon.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:07.22,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pigs wallow in mud.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:09.47,0:08:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Salmon swim upstream\Nagainst the current.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:12.89,0:08:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:14.81,0:08:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They're cutting in front of us too.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:16.56,0:08:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost, you bitches!\NCome on, say something to them!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:19.15,0:08:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you,\NI'm trying to do the opposite.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I let people cut in line.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:24.36,0:08:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come here.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:26.37,0:08:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you cut in front of me.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me, bitch.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:31.54,0:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the back, you skank!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:33.62,0:08:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you call me, bitch?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.71,TiretsDefault,,792,0,0,,– What?\N– Look at this.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:37.92,0:08:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easier to help myself.\NChild's play.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:44.09,0:08:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where's Hermes?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:47.09,0:08:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen her in days.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:49.64,0:08:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:54.64,0:08:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She's following a man?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:56.56,0:08:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes is really doing that?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:57.98,0:09:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Every morning for a while now.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:00.90,0:09:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when you got shot, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:08.78,0:09:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's going on in the yard.\NIt's bad.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:15.95,0:09:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:19.79,0:09:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The inmate Hermes is following?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. You know all the rumors\Ngoing around in here.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:30.76,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:32.26,0:09:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm honored you came to see me.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:36.18,0:09:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't think\NI'd tell you for free, did you?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:40.64,0:09:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to pay me.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:42.44,0:09:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a friendly price.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:52.95,0:09:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.82,0:09:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"The body of a woman unknowingly\Ncaught up in gang violence
Dialogue: 9,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,was found\Nby the river before dawn."
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A local Florida newspaper.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:03.46,0:10:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from six years ago.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:05.13,0:10:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Gwess was right.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:09.71,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria Costello.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:11.51,0:10:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's Hermes' older sister.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:19.22,0:10:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These past few days,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.52,0:10:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've waited for the right moment{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:23.15,0:10:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}watching you closely.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:26.65,0:10:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know why you've changed,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:28.90,0:10:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I saw you sweeping\Nthe old prison's cemetery.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.57,0:10:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You also left\Nflowers on a grave.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:35.28,0:10:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was it for your gang members{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:37.33,0:10:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}executed on the electric chair?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I also saw you{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.75,0:10:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}stuffing birds and alligators\Nin the prison workshop.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:47.17,0:10:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why would a grunt like you\Nsuddenly be interested in that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It doesn't matter.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:54.84,0:10:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I must know one thing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:01.72,0:11:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, F.F.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You look well.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, your breakfast.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:13.24,0:11:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,about the man you're following...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:15.41,0:11:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, following? I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play innocent.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:20.08,0:11:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Sports Max.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a notorious gangster on the outside.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's locked up in the men's ward.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:27.09,0:11:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Not that it's any of my business.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:30.34,0:11:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:31.51,0:11:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You were sent here for armed robbery.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:38.59,0:11:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you do it on purpose\Nto get sent here?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:43.02,0:11:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,To get revenge on Sports Max\Nfor your sister's death.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:48.36,0:11:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't meddle in other\Npeople's business in prison.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:50.82,0:11:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:52.11,0:11:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing the opposite today.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:58.03,0:11:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of it.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:59.91,0:12:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the women's ward.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:03.74,0:12:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes is right.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:06.50,0:12:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to focus\Non your own mission.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:09.67,0:12:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait a little longer, Gloria.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:15.67,0:12:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll avenge you with my own hands.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:23.01,0:12:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.93,0:12:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of me as your mother\Nfrom now on.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From that day on,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:35.73,0:12:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gloria,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:37.20,0:12:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you always put\Nfamily first.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hermes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:44.16,0:12:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You could help me\Nat the restaurant once in a while.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:46.88,0:12:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to inherit\NDad's restaurant with me.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:51.92,0:12:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care. I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:55.21,0:12:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a scholarship\Nto go to college.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:58.97,0:13:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:01.56,0:13:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:04.43,0:13:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:18.82,0:13:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:21.78,0:13:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me that stick with your mouth.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:25.62,0:13:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the way a dog would,\Nbut like a baby.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't care to see\Nwhat happens in the dark.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:49.86,0:13:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I wouldn't report it\Nto the authorities either.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:52.85,0:13:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The darkness will take care\Nof those who live in it. {\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:57.11,0:14:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the only way to keep\Na restaurant open in this town.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.65,0:14:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that night...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.79,0:14:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gloria had no choice\Nbut to risk calling the police.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:20.01,0:14:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She did it to protect me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But even so...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Defendant Sports Max,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:27.85,0:14:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you are sentenced to five years in prison
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.06,0:14:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,for fraud and assault.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:32.23,0:14:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Five years? Only five years?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:36.36,0:14:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't nail him\Nwith an unconvincing witness.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:40.28,0:14:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the best we can do.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:42.03,0:14:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He had her killed!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:44.24,0:14:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He destroyed all the evidence.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:48.41,0:14:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bullshit.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.83,TiretsDefault,,710,0,0,,– Wait, damn it!\N– Stop!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:55.21,0:14:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember her.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:17.23,0:15:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:20.07,0:15:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You must never forget Gloria.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.19,0:15:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:35.12,0:15:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this chance\Nfor a long time.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:38.59,0:15:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I waited until you were alone\Nso no one would hear your screams.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:43.72,0:15:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to know.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:47.22,0:15:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you did to Gloria.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:52.97,0:15:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to remember this!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:06.45,0:16:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:08.16,0:16:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to me, bitch?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.33,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sentence ends in a year.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:13.33,0:16:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're free,\Nyou'll have bodyguards.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:16.71,0:16:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But here, you're defenseless!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:21.29,0:16:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. It suits you perfectly.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:23.88,0:16:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that prison pipes\Naren't big enough for a person.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:29.13,0:16:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means\Nthey're perfect for a coffin.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just fall in there?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:36.56,0:16:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:37.98,0:16:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:39.65,0:16:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:41.82,0:16:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't understand who I am?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:46.03,0:16:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take these last moments of your life\Nto think about it.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:49.32,0:16:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You left Gloria's body\Nin the gutter.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:52.53,0:16:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And her suffering made my father sick.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:56.29,0:16:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I lost everything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:00.54,0:17:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll beg them in hell\Nfor forgiveness, Sports Max!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:04.29,0:17:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if you can still speak\Nwith your mouth full of sewage!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:12.43,0:17:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I put a second sticker\Non the pipe.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:15.47,0:17:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your coffin will close shut.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:21.19,0:17:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trapped inside now.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:22.94,0:17:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream all you want.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.11,0:17:28.78,TiretsDefault,,655,0,0,,– Bitch!\N– Go on, call for help.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:28.99,0:17:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the cockroaches\Nand the rats will hear you.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:35.91,0:17:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your place is in the gutter!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:38.58,0:17:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Try screaming, Sports Max!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.17,0:17:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who rise from the darkness,\NLimp Bizkit... join me...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:51.22,0:17:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll share our joy\Nin the darkness, Limp Bizkit...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense something.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:17.87,0:18:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming toward me.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:26.34,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This attack!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:28.55,0:18:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:29.51,0:18:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max can't be...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:44.35,0:18:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, my finger.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:47.56,0:18:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using a power.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:49.15,0:18:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I can't see it,
Dialogue: 9,0:18:51.74,0:18:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but I felt its shape.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:54.57,0:18:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It was shaped like a bird!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The sticker...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:16.80,0:19:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I win? Did I crush him?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:20.93,0:19:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have known\Nhe'd acquired a Stand power.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:24.48,0:19:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:26.06,0:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max, you've gone quiet.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:29.40,0:19:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get crushed in that pipe?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:33.15,0:19:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did the stagnant water fill your body\Nfrom mouth to anus
Dialogue: 9,0:19:36.66,0:19:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and drown you?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:04.31,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now what?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:09.35,0:20:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sports Max is still alive?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:12.86,0:20:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He must still be alive in that pipe,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hence this strange invisible power.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:26.08,0:20:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bigger than the last one.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:32.21,0:20:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fast!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:40.26,0:20:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This ability...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:41.47,0:20:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could it be the stuffed alligator\Nfrom the workshop?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:44.98,0:20:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Earlier,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:47.85,0:20:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it was the bird's corpse\Nthat was moving.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:50.40,0:20:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Invisible corpses have\Nthe ability to move.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:52.94,0:20:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're the ones attacking me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:56.28,0:20:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That bastard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:58.03,0:21:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's trying to break\Nthe pipe to free himself!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:00.45,0:21:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:02.66,0:21:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:04.50,0:21:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:06.00,0:21:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne's worried about you...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:07.63,0:21:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, F.F., stay back!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:19.09,0:21:21.43,TiretsDefault,,730,0,0,,– F.F.!\N– There's an enemy.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.64,0:21:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an alligator.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:23.09,0:21:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're under attack\Nfrom invisible dead creatures!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:33.94,0:21:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it got my leg.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:35.86,0:21:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, what's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:38.91,0:21:41.53,TiretsDefault,,587,0,0,,– Is it a Stand attack?\N– That's right.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:41.74,0:21:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that bastard Sports Max.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:43.58,0:21:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He acquired a Stand power\Nwithout me knowing.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:49.33,0:21:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! It's charging at you!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:52.29,0:21:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost on you!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:54.67,0:21:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
